{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:LiftingAndDescent.JetProlongation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"LiftingAndDescent.JetProlongation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.Glossary","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.CategoricalFoundations","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Functor.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Module.Basic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.jet_prolongation_preserves_observability","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.jet_prolongation_preserves_observability","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation.lean#L68-L86","doc":"The jet prolongation of a QOU is again a QOU.\n\nThe key content: observability (adjoint vanishing) is preserved because\nAd(A) = 0 implies Ad(J¹(A)) = 0 — any invariant in Ad(J¹(A)) would\nproject to a non-zero invariant in Ad(A), contradicting the hypothesis.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{prop:jet-prolongation}` (conclusion) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetProlongation.unitSection_mono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetProlongation.unitSection_mono","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation.lean#L65-L65","doc":"The unit section is a monomorphism (canonical embedding A ↪ J¹(A)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetProlongation.jet_frobenius","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetProlongation.jet_frobenius","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation.lean#L61-L61","doc":"The Frobenius relation holds for the inherited structure:\nμ' ≫ Δ' = (Δ' ▷ J¹(A)) ≫ α ≫ (J¹(A) ◁ μ'). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetProlongation.jetFrobForm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetProlongation.jetFrobForm","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation.lean#L58-L58","doc":"The inherited Frobenius form λ' : J¹(A) → 𝟙. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetProlongation.jetComul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetProlongation.jetComul","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation.lean#L56-L56","doc":"The inherited comultiplication Δ' : J¹(A) → J¹(A) ⊗ J¹(A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetProlongation.jetMul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetProlongation.jetMul","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation.lean#L54-L54","doc":"The inherited multiplication μ' : J¹(A) ⊗ J¹(A) → J¹(A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetProlongation.unitSection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetProlongation.unitSection","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation.lean#L52-L52","doc":"The canonical inclusion A ↪ J¹(A) via the unit section. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetProlongation.jet_is_tensor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetProlongation.jet_is_tensor","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation.lean#L50-L50","doc":"J¹(A) is the tensor product of A with Ω¹(A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetProlongation.jetObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetProlongation.jetObj","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation.lean#L48-L48","doc":"The jet object J¹(A) = A ⊗ Ω¹(A) in C. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetProlongation.differentials","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetProlongation.differentials","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation.lean#L46-L46","doc":"The Kähler differentials Ω¹(A) as an object of C.\nAbstractly: Ω¹(A) = ker(μ : A ⊗ A → A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetProlongation.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetProlongation.mk","kind":"ctor","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetProlongation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetProlongation","kind":"structure","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation.lean#L28-L66","doc":"**Jet prolongation data**: the categorical jet object J¹(A) = A ⊗ Ω¹(A)\ntogether with its inherited Frobenius–Hopf structure.\n\nThe four steps of the proof are:\n1. Ω¹(A) = ker(μ : A ⊗ A → A) is a direct summand (Frobenius non-degeneracy).\n2. The Frobenius relation restricts to J¹(A), giving (Δ', ε', S').\n3. Non-degeneracy of the pairing on A passes to J¹(A).\n4. Adjoint vanishing: Ad(A) = 0 implies Ad(J¹(A)) = 0.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{prop:jet-prolongation}`\nRef: [leitner2026] §3 ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:jet-prolongation","label":"prop:jet-prolongation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}